        "final": "Fixed wchunk package to match the authoritative samples in assets/. Key changes:\n\n1. **Header format**: Changed record count from big-endian to little-endian u32 (offset 5-8)\n2. **Record layout**: Replaced uvarint encoding with fixed u16 LE for both tag and size; added 8-byte alignment with zero padding after each record\n3. **Footer structure**: Extended from 4 to 6 bytes - CRC-32 (u32 LE) followed by tag-sum checksum (u16 LE, sum of all tags mod 2^16)\n4. **CRC algorithm**: Removed final XOR to use standard zlib.crc32 directly, matching the common CRC-32 variant\n5. **Error classification**: Proper truncated/structure/checksum distinction with tag-sum validation\n\nThe implementation now satisfies all acceptance criteria: verify(sample) returns True, pack(unpack(sample)) == sample for both samples, streaming uses only fixed-size reads, and error kinds match the spec."
